		"Id": "mechdef_sunder_SD1-OSM",
		"Name": "Samual",
		"Details": "Originally designed by MechWarrior Tanisha Brown of the DCMS for use against infantry forces, the Samual turned out to also be very effective in the gameworld arenas. While MechWarrior Brown claimed that her Sunder configuration was created at the orders of her superior in the DCMS, Solaris mechjocks decided that they didn't really care and adopted the config anyways. The Samual is equipped with a terrifying battery of close-range weaponry, including 6 SRM-4s and a whopping 12 Machine Guns. Four Flamers assist the SRMs (which usually come with Inferno ammunition equipped) in frying enemies alive. A lone ER PPC is the sole concession to armored foes. 4 tons of SRM ammo and 2 tons of Machine Gun ammo keep the weapons firing in almost any arena battle.",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_sunder"
	},
